<section class="help">
  <h1>How to update the website</h1>
  <p class="help__lead">This guide is for Hall of Fame committee members. You do not need to know anything about websites. Everything on the site comes from <strong>one Google Sheet</strong>. Change the sheet and the website updates itself overnight.</p>

  <div class="help__callout">
    <strong>Remember:</strong> changes show up on the website <strong>the next morning</strong> (the site refreshes itself around 4&nbsp;a.m. every night). Can't wait? <a href="#update-now">Update the website right away</a> from the sheet's <strong>Website</strong> menu.
  </div>

